# Larger Debian Trixie application intake for the AuziX package bot.
#
# Entries become runnable only after they have an AuziX JSON recipe and an
# allowlisted package builder in a source catalog. This file is the intake
# list, not an instruction to install Debian packages into the base image.

# Development
binutils
build-essential
clang
cmake
gcc
git
make
meson
ninja-build
pkg-config
python3
python3-pip
rustc
cargo

